open-vm-tools-wayland (13.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Package open-vm-tools 13.1.0 with the Wayland work: clipboard and
    drag-and-drop over the Wayland data-control protocols, and pointer
    integration through the XDG RemoteDesktop portal and libei.
  * Carry the fixes for upstream issues #800 (GTK4 clipboard size) and
    #805 (resolutionSet claiming the resolution server role).
  * Provides, Conflicts and Replaces open-vm-tools, so the distribution
    package is removed when this one is installed.

